sentences.text:
9. Let the applicant- Vaibhav Singh be released on bail in Case Case Crime No. 43 of 2023, under Section 420, 411 I.P.C. and Section 66 of Information of Technology (Amendment) Act, 2008,
registered at Police Station Bewana, District Ambedkar Nagar, on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to the following conditions: -
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

